{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46679","headline":"闻西蟾从弟卜岩居岳西有寄 · 齐己","name":"闻西蟾从弟卜岩居岳西有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瀑布见高低，岩开岩壁西。\n碧云多旧作，红叶几新题。\n滴沥中疎磬，嵌空半倚梯。\n仍闻樵子径，□不到前溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}